{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "1e2ac1f4035fa45b3b54b6185431d6f4beb11b4f8e4d03317731343f9f591412", "ja": "激突", "zh": "冲突", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c179e1447ee7a66aeb9d51594a819d3b046ad9c2f7c56f2eb07239a6b8797e04", "ja": "戸惑い不安がる春香を元気づけるやよいは、\n自分の戦具は『陰界の王』がくれたと話す。\nそこへ、このみとのり子率いる追撃隊が急襲\nを仕掛けてくる。歩とジュリアが応戦し、激\nしい戦いが始まった。", "zh": "面对困惑不安的春香，弥生鼓起精神，并告诉她自己的战具是“阴界之王”赐予的。\n就在这时，由木实和法子率领的追击队发动了突袭\n。步和茱莉亚迎战，一场激烈的战斗就此开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "31b4a24aae5707099c1a468b2076b215370427a2fa9b6a605ed0e39812fbdd63", "ja": "―忘れられた街―", "zh": "―被遗忘的街区―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "af904c69c81821420ff6a1ccd444a55c724b51755a0d53d0460face508b67f23", "ja": "春香さーん、お疲れさまですー！\nこれからどうしようかって、もう思いつきました？", "zh": "春香姐——，您辛苦啦！\n接下来要怎么办，有想到什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "1120d42ae958a739deec56a83b85c2d1d95fd28184834ae0fa5e7f489ad01779", "ja": "やよい……ううん、まだ全然だよ。\nだって私、本当に何一つ知らなかったから。", "zh": "弥生……没有，还完全没头绪呢。\n毕竟我真的什么都不知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "d15670f80e760cd9a09dff7e818993d2bad180574042ca549c8e5ef36e1c1ee9", "ja": "私が毎日、普通に過ごしてる裏で……\n不思議な力を持った人たちがいて、戦ってて。", "zh": "在我每天平平常常地生活的背后……\n竟然有拥有神奇力量的人们，在战斗着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "ec6ca25e3095b9b08eff3d259c91cd94102a7360c21bc90ae52456611fe8e876", "ja": "こんな街があったり、記憶を操作されたりとか……\n説明を聞いても、現実感が湧いてこないんだ。", "zh": "有这样的街道，记忆还会被操纵什么的……就算听了说明，也还是没有现实感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "3302e7fd60646f45cfc4e0cb424a592a8d6c57e00522a5d570071da3deefc30e", "ja": "ですよね、うーん……\nでも、私も似たようなものかも？", "zh": "是啊，嗯……\n不过，我可能也差不多吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "23fd311fb525f0d367be84f87249b15a917e26fafa8ea51ce915a7a1777a23a4", "ja": "やよいには、あんなに大きなカエルがいるのに？\n戦いとか、強いんじゃないの？", "zh": "可是弥生明明有那么大的一只青蛙啊？\n战斗之类的，难道不是很强吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "f8331693f32c53cef2cf536c1e1a851fa1007208bd2334760c0022a8606171dd", "ja": "実はヴェロチョロは、私の戦具じゃなくて……\n『陰界の王』さんにもらったんです。", "zh": "其实贝罗丘罗并不是我的战具……\n而是“阴界之王”先生送给我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "a368d86f935927a8efda6eff3878f79f1fc8e753e129675dad581c64ee43c9c1", "ja": "いんかいの、おう……？", "zh": "阴界之王……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "0c979e0253680faa2a44e262a915a8275470bb2b72a5ecbd09c8215fcfbf861a", "ja": "私の夢の中に出てきた人が、そう名乗ってたんです。\n「やよいは、戦具を持てないんだね」って言われて……", "zh": "梦里出现的那个人，就是这么自称的。他还对我说：“弥生，你没法拿战具呢。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "0948aa440d25b2fe37c988fc5931758db85a7e359983f508206c4ac6c9c511ad", "ja": "「そのままじゃ大変そうだし、私のをいっこあげる」\nって、ヴェロチョロをくれたんですよ。", "zh": "“这样下去会很辛苦吧，我把我的战具送你一件。”  \n那个人就把维罗乔罗给我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "723d90521a401099333520449a6e922dd66394fefce9d7b02194bd7e4f7d43ac", "ja": "自分の戦具じゃないからなのかな？\nなんか、自分で戦ってる気がしなくて……。", "zh": "是因为那不是自己的武器吗？总觉得不像是在靠自己战斗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "fc865e52e738b404e994cf4b1f058496d614594dd31208f01cc9fe1e8afae9d8", "ja": "不思議な話……でも、やっぱり羨ましいな。\n私、今だって怖くて……見て、手が震えてる。あはは。", "zh": "真是不可思议……不过，我还是好羡慕啊。\n我现在也还是很害怕……你看，我的手都在发抖。啊哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "83ed9b8fee1dc0cf0d2d49efe661f78dbf0f87791b068cc8c8324d6811d44577", "ja": "春香さん……。", "zh": "春香小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "eab2b6c6b75f622ad558193e694f2b736f22aa2ccdcbc6085a67be2e2d4ee1e5", "ja": "（……？　あれは……ああ、そうか。これは夢か……\nあれは、あたしだ。まだ『司書』だった頃のあたし）", "zh": "（……？那是……啊，是这样吗。这是梦啊……\n那是我。还是『图书管理员』时的我）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "87a8816bee140ee2c0fa506e7229958e3befc3b44b84a934d95c6e26ab636f3a", "ja": "（あの頃、あたしには友達がいた。たった一人の……\n痛みを分かち合える、友達が）", "zh": "（那时候，我有一个朋友。唯一一个……\n能与我分担痛苦的朋友）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1017_unknown", "source_sha256": "8275d31cea403e57db23a3764917e829d285cfef4c40c029eeb8c6574f2a2f01", "ja": "ジュリアさん……私、普通の女の子に\nなってみたいかも。", "zh": "茱莉亚先生……我，或许想试着成为普通的女孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1018_unknown", "source_sha256": "4f46867bc0e05da1aa28b273ac76e608ff7d8e7b7fd6b70f6346f9e6499ac9f3", "ja": "そうしたら、友達と買い物に行ったり、\nクレープ食べたり、パフェ食べたりしたいなって。", "zh": "这样的话，我想和朋友一起去买东西，\n再吃可丽饼、芭菲什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "ec9a4b61e11ec396361163fd15a1ee86ca9053a5000d8c11797265abf902aec0", "ja": "んー……あたしとやってみるか？　今から。", "zh": "嗯……要不要现在跟我试试看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1020_unknown", "source_sha256": "401fda0b724875071a822f94bece108eac964c3597fc454260a6e71f93adbd10", "ja": "うん……でも、やっぱり私には無理かな？　だって、\n自分のことも覚えてられないかもだし。えへへ。", "zh": "嗯……不过，对我来说果然还是太难了吧？毕竟，\n我也许连自己的事都会记不住呢。嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "f44e7dc72b9ca45da0f6ec972e82c804453b682790dc19f60fd285351dd2b04d", "ja": "（あいつは、『人造司書』として生み出された。\n高い記憶保持能力を持つ、実験体だった）", "zh": "（那家伙是作为『人造图书管理员』被制造出来的。\n是拥有极强记忆保持能力的实验体）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "d10bd4d364fcdea2c22b07df91b223dd9363d489903bb8dbf3cb9b93aa35993b", "ja": "（その扱いは、普通の司書より非道で……\n運用が始まれば、自分の感情・自我さえも残されない）", "zh": "（那样的对待，比普通图书管理员更加残酷……一旦开始运作，甚至连自己的感情和自我都不会留下）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "d3bb10d070a562358f643bcc9a5fd9dc5e19cb08bb59e41d63b9ac45a347a518", "ja": "（あいつはずっと謝ってた。覚えていられなくて、\nごめんなさい、って……だから、あたしは……！）", "zh": "（那家伙一直在道歉。因为没能记住，\n一直说着“对不起”……所以，我才……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1024_se", "source_sha256": "12ddbca1807a6849001f3dce43909b9e835135a3e8a0e87c3b610bf73ea2bbf8", "ja": "ズドオォォーンッ！", "zh": "轰隆隆——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "d267eb90f403f94319e559e15f85af6d8a9f46cf6a61c2bc5d8adbe3650b4093", "ja": "ハッ！？　……なんだ、今のは！？", "zh": "哈！？……刚才那是什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1026_doumeiintati", "source_sha256": "ee0b9f96e7648f889ae9298c9a231ea9655406d7061a20fa8a619429e22fb611", "ja": "うわああぁーっ！？　キャアアァーッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊——！？　呀啊啊啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1027_se", "source_sha256": "f3429af89e27de750bb10365669fbf893b1ae49fa9e869c54883abdadb34370d", "ja": "ザッ、ザッ、ザッ、ザッ……", "zh": "沙、沙、沙、沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "c6ccc727bcad0b6046d7d2b94d19c690bfdac5a0a579012845904f57c68669e8", "ja": "戦具使いが出たら、相手をせずに報告すること。\n私たちが対処します。では、作戦開始！", "zh": "如果出现使用战斗装备的人，不要与其交战，直接报告。\n由我们来处理。那么，作战开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1029_taiintati", "source_sha256": "41f27c077a7ca7bef8d0d6a2b41b8f7c9833141a2e4da51d2e03d9e42d90d614", "ja": "了解（ヤーッ）！", "zh": "收到（呀——）！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "e8e81b12ab40d8d86ef92bcd7fedaee9b57a211a23e3f6f442e5230a486d0279", "ja": "はぁ、アタシまで駆り出されるとはねー……\nま、たまにはいっか。準備運動ってことで。", "zh": "唉，没想到连我都被拉来帮忙了——……\n不过，偶尔一次也没事。就当是做准备运动吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1031_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9491062c077e806ad2e1a9c7bed676b18dfe43f19c3707dbf30684fd1dc3aeae", "ja": "へえ、鬼の副長様と、陽界の王がおでましとはね……。\nだったら、全員まとめて楽しんでいきなよ！", "zh": "哦，连鬼之副长大人和阳界之王都登场了啊……既然如此，就大家一起玩个痛快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d054e94984fca5a0e1fe1792c384c72bf51c1de9c511a4c950567304fb235c30", "ja": "レッツ・ダンス、『タイニー・ディスコ』！", "zh": "一起跳舞吧，《Tiny Disco》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1033_taiintati", "source_sha256": "1ab77e19cc9e78f4839246e1f85b604e100852d2caa85346b19e073b791a3369", "ja": "なっ、なんだ！？　体が勝手に……！", "zh": "啊、怎么回事！？身体竟然擅自动起来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1034_se", "source_sha256": "c21a864a9be297a4fa0318b6669616875d067a774cc82a9b574316cc27c7df43", "ja": "ザッ、ザッザッザッ♪　クルクル、シュバッ♪", "zh": "嚓、嚓嚓嚓♪　呼呼、唰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "75c02000a0bb1477bfe1fe88c41f0e16aa18855488dcb421b6bfba78f96fd585", "ja": "あらら、みんなダンスし始めちゃったわ……\nって、私まで！？　なるほど、こういう戦具ね……！", "zh": "哎呀呀，大家都开始跳舞了……\n等等，连我也！？原来如此，这就是所谓的战斗装备啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9665efc7e250bb2ccdcbbbb79ab9f8304dd8a49266192df95f769effa1b56cb1", "ja": "アタシが、踊ってる限り！　アンタらも、ダンスしか、\nできない！　みんな！　今のうちに、逃げろ！", "zh": "只要我还在跳舞！你们也就只能跳舞！大家！趁现在，快逃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "90912adc56962b270d8aadf16d1b6083d073820797620ffac13c4374f7f48524", "ja": "なるほどね、じゃあ……こうだっ！", "zh": "原来如此，那就……这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1038_se", "source_sha256": "4a7384cf0f31bad47cbbbb52a7b3396893c58fcd42bc865920c5cae674a3ee81", "ja": "ドゴォッ！", "zh": "咚轰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1039_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8cd4c4b676aa2f4b111d9806420b22712bc5490403098797d893ea6d814effb1", "ja": "ぐはあっ！？　な、なんで……\n攻撃は、できないはず……ぐふっ！？", "zh": "呜哇！？为、为什么……\n按理说，应该没法攻击才对……咳呃！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1040_043nor", "source_sha256": "418d073690f8d9a492f67a4096ddb29f64b197900d4d86849bd8d5f7b93d0955", "ja": "攻撃なんかしてないよ？\n今のは、ダンスしてたら接触しちゃっただけ。", "zh": "我又没攻击你啊？\n刚才只是跳舞的时候不小心碰到了而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1041_039kon", "source_sha256": "919c825079ffb3ce795184164b92c116aab163d0bccfa067c22423137bfcf1d3", "ja": "ほんと、呆れるほどのフィジカルしてるわよねー。", "zh": "真是强得让人都无语了呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1042_034ayu", "source_sha256": "84318989d9b0d33428158ed73580aa82a6adf80d60df89ff855093f79dfb784c", "ja": "ぐっ、ダメだ、まだ……！\nみんなが逃げ切るまで、ダンスは、やめない……！", "zh": "唔，还不行，我还不能……！\n在大家成功逃走之前，我不会停下跳舞……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1043_043nor", "source_sha256": "26b57109c835ff9dfc16757bb6df0ecff6792fae6e1d486bae42890c3a8b1bac", "ja": "おおっ、やるじゃん！　根性あるね。\nそれじゃ、もっとアタシと……レッツ・ダンス♪", "zh": "哦哦，干得不错嘛！挺有毅力的嘛。\n那就和我继续……一起跳舞吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1044_se", "source_sha256": "fc97329c4831551fc945e588ddce23e678d628e8807c7da25b60340d2fc20780", "ja": "ドガッ！　バギャッ！　ドゴオッ……", "zh": "咚！砰！轰——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1045_005yay", "source_sha256": "03983d98f1b37d02c36fa65fc36f6a8457f0df127cb5a66895003c853055679f", "ja": "あ、ああっ！？　歩さんが……歩さーん！", "zh": "啊、啊啊！？步小姐她……步小姐——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1047_043nor", "source_sha256": "42ab45676c948c746062e9af4c826997300bb0aabe70643dd893ec825a6af4e2", "ja": "ふぅ……こんなに耐えられるなんて、負けた気分。\nゴメンね、このみさん。かなり逃げられちゃった。", "zh": "呼……居然能撑这么久，感觉像输了。  \n对不起，木实姐，逃掉了不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1048_039kon", "source_sha256": "55c98b5c81b6aeca8b5aab2e3702e273e37230f29919067c720d042daab8d546", "ja": "いいわ、『反忘却同盟』の幹部が確保できれば、\n他の全員に逃げられたってお釣りがくるわよ、ウフフ♪", "zh": "好啦，只要能抓住“反遗忘同盟”的干部，就算其他人全都逃掉，也完全够本了，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1049_005yay", "source_sha256": "c90f38ad8740a832f2c539ed4813086a79b5bdb590a90b8c6478c47a995e17e7", "ja": "ううっ……カモン、『ヴェロチョロ』！", "zh": "呜呜……来吧，Verochoro！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1050_verotyoro", "source_sha256": "1b21b7d945a1c80a7c5b83241ad1784414d3e55e81427ac26a1c308ea7689699", "ja": "ヴェロオォォーッ！", "zh": "维罗——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1051_se", "source_sha256": "1271f2ac589969680e0dfddfe953b6b7286443299e19e0713b30d517111fdfad", "ja": "ドッゴオォーンッ！！！！", "zh": "轰隆——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1052_043nor", "source_sha256": "f0131c89fde9bceb83d57fa73e4b3b3cdb0035032f9e67fb2904c07e2ee12dbf", "ja": "うぐっ！？　へえ……アタシに両手を使わせるとはね。\nホント、たまには生徒会室から出てみるもんだ。", "zh": "唔！？　嘿……居然能逼我用出双手啊。\n真是的，偶尔离开一下学生会办公室果然是对的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1053_se", "source_sha256": "02170a2a889f01624c47bce13f38338736e83556f43110177eca31cbfec07285", "ja": "ミシミシミシッ……！", "zh": "咯吱咯吱咯吱……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1054_050jul", "source_sha256": "77a33f5bfd521f7a43d7b516d9ef03fc6ddcad6ed571e803ad989f452ef79236", "ja": "……『プラネット・ライナー』！", "zh": "……《行星班车》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1055_se", "source_sha256": "297d6085e36d29f7a414b408a9e9b2e7309264223227d266272105255fc2cc11", "ja": "シュンッ！　ドゴォッ！", "zh": "唰！　咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1056_043nor", "source_sha256": "1fcbe012ade80ef6442d9dc5c6d9b8b33f365ea51e393e5d73675ac939792345", "ja": "ぐふっ！？　こ、これは……！\nただのパンチで、アタシが膝を……？", "zh": "呃！？这、这是……！\n只是普通的一拳，竟然就让我跪下了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1057_039kon", "source_sha256": "bdfa43d9c352b2423b38e3c7d52cc01d430c0365d4d39bbbab51678d682fba12", "ja": "のり子ちゃん、下がって！\n追撃はさせないわ……匂い立て、『面影香』！", "zh": "纪子，退后！\n我不会让你继续追击的……散发香气吧，《面影香》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1058_se", "source_sha256": "09509d97e864c1706cb83366098924ca7f1819b6b8877d6294c482795a2daa99", "ja": "シュウゥゥゥ……ヴンッ！", "zh": "咻呜呜呜……嗡！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1059_konominosyugorei", "source_sha256": "e6aaa6e3f153236f3587597d3e0d17cb3606400a0c0c376da4406434aa43b1f7", "ja": "シ、イィィィ……セク……シィィィ……！", "zh": "好、好好好……性、性感……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1060_050jul", "source_sha256": "bc84b3f519f8faaeb97875d801fff9b2226618baf7772e38551e41ffc435af88", "ja": "くっ、ユニット操作型の戦具か……邪魔だな。\nおい、二人とも大丈夫か！？　悪い、遅れた！", "zh": "啧，这是操纵组合的战具吗……真碍事。\n喂，你们两个没事吧！？抱歉，我来晚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1061_043nor", "source_sha256": "4c00eccf55211e565fa92f98080a1f7548827dae6fad2416e4246394f083c14b", "ja": "アンタは……ジュリア！\nいいねえ、一度やり合いたいと思ってたんだ！", "zh": "你是……茱莉亚！\n太好了，我早就想和你较量一场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1062_039kon", "source_sha256": "44cac0931c35147fd4e188d4359a88646b06e0101d7be59ae1744e491a2a02a3", "ja": "『反記録者（アンチ・クロニクリスト）』の\nお出ましね……のり子ちゃん、二人でやるわよ。", "zh": "『反记录者（安提·克罗尼克利斯特）』现身了呢……典子，我们两个一起上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0427_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_04_1063_001har", "source_sha256": "108f396d8ec7c8ba1266359752568e1d7a532f1928fade8a0187c6d50abd0f78", "ja": "う、うぅ……う……あ、頭が……！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……呜……啊，头好痛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
